(v)
Mineral mixture;
(4)
?Animal feed inspector? means any officer of Animal Husbandry Department who is designated as Animal Feed
Inspector by Controlling authority;
(5)
?Animal feed analysis? means procedures of animal feed analysis to verify moisture, crude protein, crude fiber, Acid
insoluble ash, Gross energy, amino acids and other parameters of animal feed sample;
(6)
?Animal feed analyst? means the person carrying out the Animal feed analysis in the animal feed analysis laboratory;
(7)
?Animal feed analytical laboratory? means the laboratory notified for the purpose of analyzing the samples of animal
feed;
(8)
?Animal feed business? means animal feed manufacture, dealership/ distribution, sale and all allied activities;
